Iterative Refinement: The continuous feedback loop between GNNs and SA enhances the optimization process, allowing real-time adaptability.

Significance of the Work

This hybrid approach demonstrates substantial improvements across various urban management metrics:

Traffic Management: Achieved a 25% reduction in congestion and an 18% decrease in average travel times.

Resource Allocation: Improved efficiency by 30% and reduced wastage by 20%.

Infrastructure Optimization: Increased cost efficiency by 22% and accessibility by 15%.

